\item[S2] Erdos, Paul, Diagonal Ramsey numbers, Open Problem Garden, node 351. Complete problem, discussion and bibliography (including mathematical image alt text). \url{https://www.openproblemgarden.org/op/diagonal_ramsey_numbers}.
